{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/AboutMeBanner1.png?t=1741234787\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You're just a kid.</i> Mom is sick. Dad is missing. It's up to you to overcome the sinister magic that poisons your world and bring your family back together.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/AboutMeBanner2.png?t=1741234787\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve intricate puzzles and evade  obstacles with precise, skillful platforming. Collect  musical instruments that change your environment with ancient magic, and gain skills and items that enhance your ability to move through that environment, unlocking new areas and leading you to your ultimate goal.</p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/AboutMeBanner3.png?t=1741234787\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>But be careful,</i>\u00a0the hidden evil that threatens your life has sent dark spirits and terrible gatekeepers to hinder your efforts. These beings cannot be fought, <i>so</i>\u00a0<i>you will have to be smart!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3559040?t=1741234787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/97c37e6c0ebcab216adc14f9dae28913f660bcce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741234787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/1aea231abbb1dcd64689355737c7f7b8ae1a665d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741234787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/1aea231abbb1dcd64689355737c7f7b8ae1a665d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741234787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_